# Redirects for Cloudflare Workers static assets. Real 301s, unlike Astro's
# static `redirects`, which can only emit a meta-refresh page.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/

# The content editor (CMS) lives on its own worker. /admin sends editors there.
/admin   https://healthhub-cms-auth.clent.workers.dev/  302
/admin/  https://healthhub-cms-auth.clent.workers.dev/  302

